		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "fadea9e1-c43e-4290-b38b-4c53372bb6f6")
		(at 158.5 50.275)
		(descr "PLACEHOLDER footprint for Qorvo/Decawave DWM3000 UWB transceiver module, 24-pin 1.4mm-pitch side-castellated LGA, body 13x23x2.9mm. Body outline and overall pin count/layout (8 pins left edge, 8 right edge, 8 bottom edge, none on top -- matches Qorvo DWM3000 Data Sheet Rev B May 2021, Figure 8) are real/confirmed. Individual pad width/height and exact inset are ESTIMATES, not independently measured -- the datasheet Figure 14 land-pattern drawing's side-column total (12.925mm for 8 pads) did not cleanly resolve against the datasheet's own stated 1.4mm pitch, so this is flagged PLACEHOLDER per project convention. Verify against Qorvo DWM3000 Data Sheet Rev B, Section 7.2 Figure 14 'Module Land Pattern' before fabrication.")
